## Automio local secrets (gitignored as local.properties)
## Copy to local.properties and fill for local debug only.
## Prefer App「更多设置 → 语音服务」/「模型管理」(Android Keystore) for real use.
## Values below are baked into the APK BuildConfig — do not commit real keys.

# automio.msSpeechKey=
# automio.msSpeechRegion=eastasia
# automio.audioAsrProviderId=ms
# automio.xfAppId=

## Release signing (optional, local assembleRelease only).
## CI uses GitHub Secrets; never commit keystore or passwords.
# automio.release.storeFile=keys/automio-release.keystore
# automio.release.storePassword=
# automio.release.keyAlias=automio
# automio.release.keyPassword=
